==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's double rare and super rare illustrations were first featured on {{TCG ID|Paradox Rift|Armarouge ex|27}} from the {{TCG|Paradox Rift}} expansion.
*'''Armor''' is an {{TCG|Ability}} that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Guardians Rising|Golisopod|9}} from the {{TCG|Guardians Rising}} expansion.
*{{m|Armor Cannon}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Armarouge}} can learn.

